"start":172,"eind":174}]},{"ref":"jona/3/9","tekst":" Wie weet, God mocht Zich wenden, en berouw hebben; en Hij mocht Zich wenden van de hitte van Zijn toorn, dat wij niet vergingen!","woorden":[{"woord":"mocht","start":15,"eind":20},{"woord":"Zich","start":21,"eind":25},{"woord":"en","start":34,"eind":36},{"woord":"hebben","start":44,"eind":50},{"woord":"en","start":52,"eind":54},{"woord":"Hij","start":55,"eind":58},{"woord":"mocht","start":59,"eind":64},{"woord":"Zich","start":65,"eind":69},{"woord":"van","start":77,"eind":80},{"woord":"de","start":81,"eind":83},{"woord":"van","start":90,"eind":93},{"woord":"Zijn","start":94,"eind":98},{"woord":"dat","start":106,"eind":109},{"woord":"wij","start":110,"eind":113}]},{"ref":"jona/3/10","tekst":"En God zag hun werken, dat zij zich bekeerden van hun boze weg; en het berouwde God over het kwaad, dat Hij gesproken had hun te zullen doen, en Hij deed het niet.","woorden":[{"woord":"En","start":0,"eind":2},{"woord":"hun","start":11,"eind":14},{"woord":"zij","start":27,"eind":30},{"woord":"zich","start":31,"eind":35},{"woord":"van","start":46,"eind":49},{"woord":"hun","start":50,"eind":53},{"woord":"en","start":64,"eind":66},{"woord":"het","start":67,"eind":70},{"woord":"het","start":89,"eind":92},{"woord":"Hij","start":104,"eind":107},{"woord":"had","start":118,"eind":121},{"woord":"hun","start":122,"eind":125},{"woord":"te","start":126,"eind":128},{"woord":"zullen","start":129,"eind":135},{"woord":"en","start":142,"eind":144},{"woord":"Hij","start":145,"eind":148},{"woord":"het","start":154,"eind":157}]},{"ref":"jona/4/1","tekst":"Dit verdroot Jona met groot verdriet, en zijn toorn ontstak.","woorden":[{"woord":"Dit","start":0,"eind":3},{"woord":"met","start":18,"eind":21},{"woord":"en","start":38,"eind":40},{"woord":"zijn","start":41,"eind":45},{"woord":"toorn","start":46,"eind":51}]},{"ref":"jona/4/2","tekst":"En hij bad tot JAHWEH, en zei: Och JAHWEH! was dit mijn woord niet, als ik nog in mijn land was? Daarom kwam ik